# --- Source lists ---
# Policy (2026-07-29): the repo publishes WHICH sources exist, not our working notes about
# them. The curated master list and the agent outbox both carry a free-text `notes` column
# holding operational commentary — what is blocked, why, and what to try next — which is
# internal working material, not a research deliverable. So:
#   * data/sources/master_sources.xlsx        -> LOCAL ONLY (researcher-owned, has `notes`)
#   * data/sources/additional_master_sources* -> LOCAL ONLY (agent outbox, has `notes`)
#   * data/sources/sources.csv                -> COMMITTED, GENERATED, notes stripped
# Regenerate the public view with:  python data/sources/export_public_sources.py
data/sources/*.txt
data/sources/*.csv
data/sources/*.xlsx
data/sources/additional_master_sources/
!data/sources/sources.csv

# personal source-merge tooling (not part of the published repo — see the outbox README)
data/sources/append_additional_sources.R
data/sources/_archive/

# --- Large / binary data artifacts ---
*.RData
*.rdata
*.feather
*.parquet

# --- R / RStudio ---
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData

# --- Retired material, kept locally for reference only (see _archive/README.md) ---
_archive/

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
